{"name": "b472_s1_base", "sha256": "c5572d1f3b0639385200b68c5ea84526f5b5eb3ebaa5dbfefbab2309631c422f", "words": 166, "headline": "Human Written", "prediction_short": "Human", "fraction_ai": 5.40394985704129e-13, "fraction_ai_assisted": 4.6870634832823014e-30, "fraction_human": 1.0, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "utc": "2026-10-23T01:39:33Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 34, 0, 185, "One of the best side-effects of learning self-hypnosis is influence literacy: an increased awareness of all the ways your attention is being shaped in your day-to-day life. By a screen?"], ["Human Written", "Medium", 29, 185, 358, " By a specific ad? By a politician? By religious fear? By erotic imprinting? By charismatic authority? By pressure to belong? By shame? By a sense of urgency? By repetition?"], ["Human Written", "High", 109, 358, 978, " It’s all around you. Sometimes it’s benign – like lullabies or prayers or being taught by a good teacher or listening to a beautiful song or being in love. But you may want to ask yourself what effect it’s having on your ability to see clearly and make choices.\nManipulation often comes with any of the following; urgency, you are special, FOMO (fear of missing out), not be included, sexual charge, shame, confused, someone will rescue you, destiny, you should obey, secret knowledge, and an excessive sense of certainty about something way too quickly and you have a sense that one good question will break the spell."]]}
{"name": "b472_s2_base", "sha256": "1d8107976f93ded02b55665d36e28f6ee69050d8510c60dba9c804fe733126cd", "words": 245, "headline": "AI Generated", "prediction_short": "AI", "fraction_ai": 1.0, "fraction_ai_assisted": 0.0, "fraction_human": 9.274817013647904e-16, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "utc": "2026-10-23T01:39:35Z", "windows": [["AI-Generated", "High", 177, 0, 869, "To turn this off, stop rehearsing it, take it out of any recordings that you have, stop having it in any apps that are active, and go back to using your regular induction that you have been using. Say that you won’t use it anymore when you are awake, but realize that just saying that it is gone won’t make it go away immediately. If you are finding that you are responding to it when you don’t want to, or you are having problems with being disoriented after using it, get some help from someone who is qualified to help you. If you want to keep it in, you can, but only for the use of starting a session at a later time when you want to. For now, today’s trance will be over when you come out of it.\nMake sure to reverse anything you’ve done to alter your state when you come out of it. If you’ve floated, make sure you regain your weight (of your choice, of course)."], ["AI-Generated", "Medium", 10, 869, 919, " If you’ve shrunk, grow to your normal size again."], ["AI-Generated", "High", 49, 919, 1165, " If you’ve regressed or met parts, make sure you come back to feeling complete in the here and now and acknowledge that your body belongs to you and is under control of the adult mind. If you’ve gone somewhere, make sure you go back the same way."], ["AI-Generated", "Medium", 1, 1165, 1175, " Etcetera."], ["AI-Generated", "High", 17, 1175, 1255, " Make sure that the only things you bring out with you are the ones you want to."]]}
{"name": "b472_s3_base", "sha256": "1eacd66a54960645e5b937961b1ddab3c2e6c3ee2f2f02758072b279f191f399", "words": 147, "headline": "Human Written", "prediction_short": "Human", "fraction_ai": 6.292864416135215e-15, "fraction_ai_assisted": 2.0062656920966013e-37, "fraction_human": 1.0, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "utc": "2026-10-23T01:39:37Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 65, 0, 346, "Then count up, using these five steps: 1...feel your body again and what it’s resting on, feel your weight (of your choice). 2...feel your breathing return to normal. 3...hear the room, name where you are. 4...wiggle your fingers and toes, move your shoulders and your eyes. 5...open your eyes, back in the here and now, feeling normal and clear."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 5, 346, 372, " This session is now over."], ["Human Written", "High", 33, 372, 547, "\nWhen you come out, remind yourself what day (or date) it is. Look to your left and your right. Look at something near, and something far. Move around a bit before getting up."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 15, 547, 624, " Get up only when you feel steady. Make sure you’re truly oriented and alert."], ["Human Written", "High", 38, 624, 813, " Don’t just assume it because you’ve done the count. Take mental note of anything that has come up for you and any actions you need to take regarding it. Then go on and do something normal."]]}
